# XORA terminal: prompt, F2 fixes, `rm` → `undo`, `on <device>`, plain-words questions with "# ...".
# It lives in the system and updates with XORA. Your own settings go at the bottom.

# XORA_PROMPT=kali      # uncomment for the Kali-style two-line prompt (then open a new terminal)

[[ -r /usr/share/xora/zshrc ]] && source /usr/share/xora/zshrc

# ---- your own settings below
